"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105675984?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov","html_url":"https://github.com/ryevdokimov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryevdokimov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-25T15:57:09Z","updated_at":"2026-04-25T15:57:09Z","body":"Can't reproduce on Windows, so it does seem to be OS specific.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4320002121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365792218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118897#issuecomment-4365792218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118897","id":4365792218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBDiz2g","user":{"login":"novaplusplus","id":3247833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDc4MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3247833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus","html_url":"https://github.com/novaplusplus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-03T08:50:31Z","updated_at":"2026-05-03T08:57:27Z","body":"I forgot to follow up on this. It's definitely more than just the 3D view. It includes stuff like the tooltips for bringing up docs when hovering over things in the inspector or similar, which don't appear if alt is held down, and are thus affected. There's a few other things I ran into that are escaping me right now.\n\nI also just tried it on a completely stock copy of 4.7 beta1 and it happens there as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4365792218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4384275693","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118897#issuecomment-4384275693","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118897","id":4384275693,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBVK87Q","user":{"login":"novaplusplus","id":3247833,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNDc4MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3247833?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus","html_url":"https://github.com/novaplusplus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/novaplusplus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-06T00:43:03Z","updated_at":"2026-05-06T00:43:03Z","body":"It seems like this applies to basically any key. If the editor loses focus while a key is held, that key won't be registered as released. I tested this by holding down W, clicking away from the editor, then going back in and holding right mouse in the 3D viewport. The camera started moving forward as if I was still holding W.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4384275693/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4404721222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118897#issuecomment-4404721222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118897","id":4404721222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABBoq2Rg","user":{"login":"norepro","id":30921834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTIxODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30921834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro","html_url":"https://github.com/norepro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/norepro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-08T07:55:07Z","updated_at":"2026-05-08T07:55:07Z","body":"I was able to reproduce this and created a PR.\n\nRoot cause is that the Godot X11 server is trying to clear the keys before the appropriate state is set, essentially making the clear attempt a no-op. Wayland is unaffected because the state is set immediately; there's no window for the reset to be ineffective.\n\nThe delay before the signal in Godot X11 is not their fault; they're correctly tolerating X11 doing X11 things. A single line was just in the wrong spot 🙂","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4404721222/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]